# Would you like to try this?!

{% embed src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/tVgQLwNkS9s" title="Video" ratio="video" /%}

Rhythm Culture Dundun dancers meet every Thursday 6.30pm for one hour of drumming , dancing and stomping fun. Get your shoes off and beat the drum with women on the Sunshine Coast!! $20 casual $70 x 4 weeks @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall
